    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests that the {@code $$} escape sequence produces a literal {@code $} and that variable substitution inside the surrounding braces still occurs. <p>Template: {@code $${${a}}} <ul> <li>{@code $$} is an escaped dollar sign, yielding a literal {@code $}.</li> <li>{@code ${a}} resolves to {@code \"1\"} (from the values map).</li> </ul> Expected result: {@code ${1}} — the outer {@code $$} becomes {@code $} and the inner variable {@code a} is substituted, but the resulting token {@code ${1}} is not resolved further because {@code \"1\"} is not a key in the map."
   },
